👑🧠 Birbal and the Stolen Ring (Raw Story)

One day, a minister came to Emperor Akbar.

He said, “My ring has been stolen!”

Akbar asked Birbal to find the thief.

Birbal gathered all the servants in a room.

He gave each of them a stick and said, “This is a magic stick. The thief’s stick will grow longer by tomorrow.”

All the servants took their sticks home.

The thief became afraid.

He thought, “If my stick grows, I will be caught.”

So he cut his stick shorter during the night.

The next day, Birbal checked all the sticks.

He found one stick shorter than the others.

Birbal said, “You are the thief!”

The servant confessed his crime.

💖 Moral:

Guilt reveals itself through fear.
